## Branch naming

```
feat/<thing>
fix/<thing>
docs/<thing>
refactor/<thing>
```

---

## Emergency override

`git push --no-verify` skips the pre-push pytest hook. Use only in a real
emergency (broken environment that needs hot fixing in `main`). Add a note
in the commit message explaining why.

Routine "tests are slow / I'll fix it later" is not legitimate use.
